rd across its 6 grids, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, and in 2025 it ran 33% of normal. September to October in 2025 ran 66% on the middle of the grids. Grid 27169 had its driest year in 1958 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
